From 472274b3d02e134e35d5ed57eff193102c894c05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 10:37:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: usb: typec: Add CYPD patches and qcs8550 DTS overlay

Type-C patches ported from downstream kernel (written by Tendai).
Device tree overlay added for the IMDT QCS8550 rev5 SBC.
Speed limited to high-speed due to enumeration issues (requires
investigation).

Co-authored-by: Tendai Makumire <tendai.makumire@imd-tec.com>
Signed-off-by: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
